                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Extensive excerpting of 's Gravenhaagse Courant and Gazette de La Haye 1750-1795 with additional data from 1725 on concerning Theater and Music (theatrical representations, concerts, editions of plays and music) and misc.</p>"
                }
              },
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>History of files and advice on usage of these data:<br>- You need the program FileMaker Pro to open this database.<br>- Due to problems opening the fp7-file in Original, DANS converted it to a fmp12-version and uploaded this file into this dataset. Please see the folder 'Processed' for the file.</p><p>No description of the metadata field; should speak for itself. If not, please contact depositor. Explanation on the main screen.</p><p>Geen aparte veldbeschrijving toegevoegd: spreekt voor zich (zo niet hoor ik het graag), toelichting op het hoofdscherm</p>"
                }
              }
